  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Was Nothing**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Suckin' The Blood From The Devil's Dick**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-04-29.Lazor_Master2448** (recommended): source not stated; 31 songs; 157 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-04-29.Lazor_Master2448**: taped by Matt\"Lazy Lightning\"Lazor; transferred by DiGiHoArDeRs: 4/30/2023; source: Neumann KM140 (ORTF / OTS / 7' up) > Zoom F3 @ 32/48 [1]. Also: Matt Lazor recorded it with Neumann KM140 microphones, set up in ORTF/OTS configuration about seven feet up, feeding a Zoom F3 at 32-bit/48kHz; Processing went from WAV through Audacity, then xACT to tagged FLAC at 24-bit/48kHz; The recording was shared under the DiGiHoArDeRs tag, dated April 30, 2023 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by admin: [Ween@ Orpheum Theater, NOLA - 4/28, 29/2023 - Cut Set](https://www.soundspaceavl.com/auctions/listing/ween-orpheum-theater-nola-4-28-229-2023/) [3]",
